{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfrvkuz6DgotcgzqHH44Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The root cause was in `billing/totals.py`: the PDF and the charged total used different rounding.\n\n**Root cause:** `line_totals()` rounds each discounted line to the cent, which is what the PDF prints. `invoice_total()` instead summed the unrounded discount amounts and rounded only once at the end. Whenever a line's discount lands on a half cent, the two disagree. Example: two lines of 1.25 with 10% off. Each prints as 1.13, so the PDF sums to 2.26, but the total computed 2.25.\n\n**Fix** (`billing/totals.py`): `invoice_total()` now sums `line_totals(inv)` and applies tax to that sum. The public API is unchanged.\n\n**Regression tests** (`tests/test_billing.py`):\n- `test_total_matches_sum_of_printed_lines_with_half_cent_discounts`: the total equals the sum of the printed lines (2.26).\n- `test_total_matches_sum_of_printed_lines_with_tax`: the same check with 19% tax applied.\n\nI ran both new tests against the original `totals.py`, and both fail there. With the fix, the full suite passes: 5 passed, 0 failed.\n\n**Things to know:**\n- The tracked `.pyc` files under `billing/__pycache__/` and `tests/__pycache__/` show as modified because pytest rewrote them. I left them alone; you probably want to discard those changes or add `__pycache__` to `.gitignore`.\n- Nothing is committed.\n- The fix changes totals only for invoices where a discount produces a half-cent. Existing invoices that hit this case will now show a total one cent different from the stored value if it was recomputed. I didn't check whether any stored totals or downstream systems rely on the old value."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9578,"cache_read_input_tokens":66582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9578},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2e01ccf-d399-48f1-98e1-c82536f6dba3","uuid":"5146d24c-f715-49b0-a48a-411ddf0ba5ec","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:49:32.509Z","request_id":"req_011CfrvkuiDTZdgvjm9B7kWu"}
